    "story": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Building something beautiful together",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>There’s something special about sharing what we do with others. Fragrance has always been at the heart of Melt, and seeing it find a place within someone else’s brand feels like a natural extension of that. That’s very much how we approach our white-label service. Not as a transaction, but as a process of building something beautiful together.</p><p>Everything we produce meets current industry standards and legal requirements. All raw materials are responsibly sourced and carefully tested, and every finished product carries the correct CLP and Health &amp; Safety labelling, approved by Trading Standards.</p><p>If you have an idea taking shape, or even just the beginnings of one, we’d love to hear about it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "full_width": false,
        "padding_top": 48,
        "padding_bottom": 24
      }
