    "products": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/white-label-candles.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "White label candles",
            "text": "<p>There’s a certain satisfaction in creating a candle that feels like your own. The weight of the glass, the first time it’s lit, the way the fragrance settles into a room. Our white-label candles are created in the same way as our own range of luxury fragranced candles: poured slowly, finished by hand, and given the time they need to develop into something beautifully balanced.</p><p>You’re welcome to use our glassware, or we can pour into your own containers if that works better for you. All of our handmade candles are vegan and never tested on animals. We don’t use palm wax, and we avoid beeswax too.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/white-label-reed-diffusers.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "White label reed diffusers",
            "text": "<p>Reed diffusers have a slightly different presence. No flame, no moment of lighting, just a gentle, continuous fragrance that quietly becomes part of the room.</p><p>Our white-label reed diffusers use the same fragrance library as our candles, so you can build a collection that feels cohesive and considered. The diffuser base is a vegan, bio-based solvent derived from renewable sources, chosen so the fragrance performs beautifully while remaining safe to use around the home.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_1",
        "row_2"
      ],
